[{"title":"塞上二首 其一","author":"肃靖王","text":"天山青控戍楼中，画角呜呜咽晚空。\n沙碛雨颓逢箭镞，战场风急转河蓬。\n李陵望国台犹在，蔡琰悲笳怨未穷。\n猎骑遥遥入霜雾，鸊鹈泉外夕阳红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上二首 其二","author":"肃靖王","text":"黄云白草出关多，飒飒风吹积石河。\n少妇愁添闺里思，征人泪落《陇头歌》。\n受降城外单于猎，温宿营边汉使过。\n强欲从军事鞍马，冯唐已老复如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日田家","author":"肃靖王","text":"屋后青山门外溪，小桥遥接稻秧畦。\n人家远近苍烟里，桑柘阴阴戴胜啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲（谋玮曰：\"此诗旨趣沉雄，王龙标不能过也\"）","author":"肃靖王","text":"远出渔阳北击胡，将军谈笑挽雕弧。\n千金底购单于首，赎得沙场战骨无？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伊州歌","author":"肃靖王","text":"霜重榆关下角鹰，水寒蒲类半成冰。\n马嘶部落征笳动，夜月穹庐泣李陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼怀古","author":"沈安王","text":"大火西流渐属金，登楼怀古独伤心。\n秦城已废烽烟息，晋岭空高草木深。\n落日鸦声依远树，残更萤点聚疏林。\n英雄回首皆黄土，独有寒云锁暮岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春","author":"沈安王","text":"东风一夜早春来，梅萼飘香帐殿开。\n旋簇五辛宜稔岁，太平无日不衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"沈宪王","text":"展转殊无寐，秋深感二毛。\n城鸦催晓色，庭树起寒涛。\n往事意何拙，浮生心自劳。\n河间今已矣，宁不愧吾曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和懒云上人韵","author":"沈宪王","text":"幽径断行踪，浮图对远峰。\n结冰坚碧沼，凝雪老青松。\n双树下开讲，千灯中现容。\n天空雨花遍，门有白云封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再哭南台从弟二首 其一","author":"沈宪王","text":"春园花树手亲栽，人去空余草木哀。\n风雨夜来谁爱惜，庭前折尽数枝梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再哭南台从弟二首 其二","author":"沈宪王","text":"千金用尽教琵琶，一旦长抛巷柳花。\n回首红颜似尘土，绿珠不属季伦家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送焦明府之凤翔（县在汉中）","author":"德平荣顺王","text":"马首蚕丛路，兹行亦壮游。\n天青三峡晓，云碧万山秋。\n鹭浴盘涡水，猿啼古驿楼。\n君才非百里，早晚梦刀州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别素愚上人","author":"德平荣顺王","text":"释子来何处，庐山复太行。\n翻经淹岁月，补衲犯冰霜。\n浩劫尘缘尽，弥天觉路长。\n智珠元不染，好去照殊方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初秋寄成都宋推府","author":"沈宣王","text":"关河西极目，山迥地连空。\n乡思牵梅柳，家书托雁鸿。\n繁云悬鸟道，瘴雾失蚕丛。\n坐听鸣笳远，悠然慷慨中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀大司马郭公二首 其一","author":"沈宣王","text":"早岁论交即见知，几年良晤信难期。\n停云北极频回首，落木西风独赋诗。\n金鼎盐梅殷相业，玉阶剑履汉官仪。\n秋高选将清边徼，画省忧心退食迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀大司马郭公二首 其二","author":"沈宣王","text":"征骖别后几登楼，极目山川忆旧游。\n皛皛霜华寒已冱，冥冥云物夕仍留。\n九关甲士图功日，三辅丁男习战秋。\n闻道天骄还北遁，万年佳气绕皇州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得闻莺送客","author":"沈宣王","text":"隔市炊烟曙色迟，小城初霁客来时。\n娇莺历历啼芳树，不解春风有别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠杨二山中丞以关内移抚山右","author":"镇康王","text":"紫辰一旦玺书催，早发秦城棨戟开。\n二华曾留标胜赋，三关更见折冲才。\n荒沙落日闲戎垒，古木飞霜凛宪台。\n壮士应看射雕处，不教胡马漠南来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别玉峰上人","author":"安庆王","text":"关山去迢递，飞锡有谁同。\n行苦三乘里，心开万法中。\n定回云满榻，偈后月低空。\n相忆听钟磬，泠然度晓风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古宫词二首 其一","author":"沈定王","text":"君王退早朝，走马长门左。\n朱楼十二重，未启黄金锁。\n春阴画阁寒，坐拨沉香火。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古宫词二首 其二","author":"沈定王","text":"闻道收辽左，中宫上寿卮。\n随班春殿里，消息未全知。\n金缕麒麟服，传宣赐太师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山僧","author":"沈定王","text":"山僧惟一食，独上危峰行。\n萧萧林木秋，众禽多悲鸣。\n我亦有脂血，慰汝饥渴情。\n但恐溪谷晦，失此衣珠明。\n徘徊竟无语，落日寒云平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食晓行","author":"沈定王","text":"轻轩冲晓色，迢递柳溪边。\n野阔群山小，云低片雨悬。\n杏花初熟酒，榆火乍浮烟。\n寂历啼莺处，伤春似旧年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落叶","author":"沈定王","text":"林塘寒雨后，摵摵下秋棚。\n绿已随衰草，黄仍缀断藤。\n高枝全见月，低鸟暗窥灯。\n不隔东窗晓，幽居爱早兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日游柏谷山寺二首 其一","author":"沈定王","text":"腊屐堪乘兴，徘徊扪薜萝。\n天临丹岭近，山入白云多。\n鸟道无方轨，龙湫有暗波。\n何时值野老，长啸出重阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日游柏谷山寺二首 其二","author":"沈定王","text":"天外闻清梵，晨光满翠微。\n杖藜苍藓滑，斫药紫参肥。\n松偃云垂盖，花分露湿衣。\n一僧能话古，去住转忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和恒斋舅答程太守见贻韵","author":"沈定王","text":"高怀少尘鞅，贳酒讯山居。\n闲幕虫丝下，秋盘鲑菜余。\n雨寒新菊吐，霜晚故林疏。\n满架多缃帙，清谈任卷舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"沈定王","text":"丹地转嶙峋，山寒未觉春。\n枯藤悬古木，独鸟咤行人。\n崖断才分径，云低欲拂巾。\n渐看天路近，下界积微尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题林虑山赵炼师精舍","author":"沈定王","text":"壶关跨天党，中有地仙乡。\n曲蹬悬星斗，危峰度石梁。\n泉声当户落，药气入云香。\n何日同真隐，来寻出世方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉学书院侍父王应教","author":"沈定王","text":"书幌晴开紫桂间，朝来满座见青山。\n茶烟织树微分缕，竹色依帘更着斑。\n风散百花随仗下，天空双鹤带云还。\n谈经昼永闻清宴，几席时时奉睿颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吕中甫还四明和程太守韵","author":"沈定王","text":"复看征橐去匆匆，况是春山暮雪中。\n旧社音书王屋下，老年杖履镜湖东。\n金鹅楼隐沧洲月，木阜松含碧落风。\n别后有怀谁共写，只应惆怅数南鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日楼居","author":"沈定王","text":"自甘养拙转愁轻，高卧春风潞子城。\n几处断云还独鸟，谁家深树响流莺。\n校书积岁非成癖，乐圣当时已近清。\n万事古来惟结舌，传经应许汉更生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄钟梅比部","author":"沈定王","text":"芙蓉双阙散晨褷，遥忆仙郎寓直归。\n风度莺声过御苑，青分柳色上朝衣。\n开帘清署文流集，点笔闲窗春鸟啼。\n为念故人频问讯，析津南望有鸿飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次黄比部题雁门关韵","author":"沈定王","text":"中华形胜一关分，贡马胡儿动百群。\n城畔星槎留使者，辕门夜鼓宴将军。\n新开汉垒多遥制，重译番书始上闻。\n独有仙曹词赋客，醉凭高堞望南云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳侍王驾登五龙山应教","author":"保定王","text":"鸾辂乘春揽物华，翩翩千骑拥朝霞。\n翠阴不断松开幕，香霭平分树吐花。\n地主龙君迎羽盖，山灵玉女献胡麻。\n凭高指顾提封遍，睿藻千年壮帝家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百卉亭联句 其一","author":"赵康王","text":"吾家亭子百花围，帘卷东风蝴蝶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百卉亭联句 其二","author":"赵康王","text":"斗酒十千须尽兴，满园春色照人衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百卉亭联句 其三","author":"赵康王","text":"迟日微风作好春，漫将诗句报花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百卉亭联句 其四","author":"赵康王","text":"樽前特上河间颂，松柏千年伴主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送句吴茂才顾圣少北上","author":"赵康王","text":"北去渡滹沱，春风一骑过。\n入燕投刺少，留赵著书多。\n明月频呼酒，青天独放歌。\n他时望南国，湖上有烟萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟出塞","author":"赵康王","text":"都护行边日，胡天雪正飞。\n朝传青海檄，暮解白登围。\n龙虎行韬略，风云入指挥。\n何当请长组，生系犬戎归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登山","author":"益庄王","text":"屏迹书巢寂寞间，篮舆乘兴远登山。\n山云挟雨忙飞去，不得逍遥共我闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神凤操","author":"太祖高皇帝","text":"钧天奏兮列丹墀，俄翩翩兮凤凰仪。\n敛翱翔兮栖梧枝，彼观德兮直为我辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲歌","author":"太祖高皇帝","text":"苑中高树枝叶云，上有慈乌乳雏勤。\n雏翎少乾呼教飞，腾翔哑哑朝与昏。\n有时力及随飞去，有时不及枝内存。\n呼来呼去翎羽硬，万里长风两翼振。\n父母双飞紧相随，雏知返哺天性真。\n吾思昔日微庶民，苦哉憔悴堂上亲。\n歔欷歔欷梦寐心不泯，人而不如鸟乎将何伸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟山 其一","author":"朱元璋","text":"游山自盘旋，俯谷仰奇巅。\n松声细入耳，云生水石边。\n敲竹猿长啸，临崖视鹿眠。\n白鹤来天翅，玄裳羽翼鲜。\n采芝携桂子，任意恣蹁跹。\n野人溪外语，黄莺啭更便。\n山静鸟归疾，林深紫暮烟。\n樵还渔罢钓，畅饮乐吾年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟山 其二","author":"朱元璋","text":"暑往钟山阿，岩幽清兴多。\n薰风自南发，森松鸣弦歌。\n玄猿啸白日，丹凤巢桐柯。\n灵芝秀深谷，祥云盛嵯峨。\n树隙观天碧，天青似绿荷。\n迥间樵采木，曲涧沿珠螺。\n鸟乐山深邃，予欢颜亦和。\n野人逢问处，乐道正婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟山赓吴沉韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"嵯峨倚空碧，环山皆拱伏。\n遥岑如剑戟，迩洞非茅屋。\n青松秀紫崖，白石生玄谷。\n岩畔毓灵芝，峰顶森神木。\n时时风雨生，日日山林沐。\n和鸣尽啼莺，善举皆飞鹄。\n山中道者禅，陇头童子牧。\n试问几经年，荅云常辟谷。\n白鹤日间朋，黄猿夜中仆。\n万岁神仙荣，千秋凡人禄。\n无知甲子寿，但觉年数福。\n彩云出洞中，鸿濛山之麓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赓僧韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"天台五百尊，方寸皆明月。\n月影弥千江，何曾有暂歇。\n为斯妙用迩，今古长不灭。\n昔当悬挂时，诚非凡可越。\n住世及应世，几度阿僧劫。\n假锡作梯航，泛海涛如雪。\n一旦杳无踪，暂与沙门别。\n鯈忽群禅中，孰能为机泄。\n禅心旷无迹，如海亦何竭。\n僧本具佛心，宗门常合辙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝光废塔","author":"朱元璋","text":"宝塔摩青苍，招提岁久荒。\n秋高栖俊隼，夜深月影长。\n寂寂星摇荡，飞霞入栋梁。\n守僧都去尽，萤火作灯光。\n鬼哭思禅度，遗经风日张。\n独有来巢燕，呢喃似宣扬。\n停骖伤古意，云合草头黄。\n闻说当年盛，钟鱼彻上方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大祀","author":"太祖高皇帝","text":"晨驾旌旄列队行，龙旗遥映凤城明。\n护霜云外天颜碧，笼水烟边山色青。\n新岁野郊春气霭，今朝村市晓晴生。\n鞠躬稽首参天处，四海讴歌贺太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟山云","author":"朱元璋","text":"踞蟠千古肇豪英，王气葱葱五色精。\n岩虎镇山风偃草，潭龙嘘气水明星。\n天开万载兴王处，地辟千秋永朕京。\n咸以六朝兴替阅，前祯祯后后嘉祯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谕临蒸县官","author":"朱元璋","text":"临蒸邑治绝遐方，巀嶪重山碧翠行。\n溪曲羊肠岚杂雾，树蟠龙体雨飞汤。\n墨云隙处天澄水，苍海空中日曜阳。\n好把寸心问民瘼，当迁离瘴任潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻人岭南郊行","author":"朱元璋","text":"极目山云杂晓烟，女萝遥护岭松边。\n陆行尽服岚霞气，水宿频吞虬蜃涎。\n晨仰际峰观拥日，暮看临海泊来船。\n信知百越风尘异，黑发人居不待年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏南越","author":"朱元璋","text":"边邑深隍嵌叠峰，土民食粟扣时舂。\n云山溪水常相合，烟树藤萝每自封。\n岭外瘴温鸣蟋蜶，海滨郁热显鰅鳙。\n常思不律皆由此，数月朱颜别旧容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹干青乐钓","author":"朱元璋","text":"旷浦澄天湿晓烟，智人乐钓稳沙前。\n蓑轻雨霁云收谷，钓掷纶抛水映船。\n举棹欲归汨月上，挂帆已近暮云边。\n汀芦处处飞萤火，照彻渔村饮不眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧羊见土鼓","author":"朱元璋","text":"群羊朝牧遍山坡，松下常吟乐道歌。\n土鼓枹时山鬼听，石泉渥处涧鸥和。\n金华谁识仙机密，兰渚何知道术多。\n岁久市中终得信，叱羊洞口白云过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横秋风吹笛","author":"朱元璋","text":"西风落木绽黄花，牛背村童笛正佳。\n曾识倚楼人听处，每闻吹月鹤升遐。\n苍江一色浑秋意，红叶初飞衬晓华。\n冷露下天星斗润，烟波声到是谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沧浪翁泛海","author":"朱元璋","text":"海天漠漠际无穷，巨舰樯高挟两龙。\n帆饱已知风力劲，舵宽方觉水声雄。\n鳌鱼背上翻飞浪，蛟蜃鬐头触见虹。\n何日定将归泊处，也应系缆水晶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题神乐观道士","author":"朱元璋","text":"仙翁调鹤欲扶穹，万里风头浩气雄。\n翎背稳乘空廓外，丹光横驾宇寰中。\n飞符到处电神集，役剑长驱疠鬼穷。\n见说黄芽心地转，更于何趣觅仙宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云衲野人","author":"朱元璋","text":"山人脩道几经年，闻说餐松足意便。\n时以断云完故衲，日将流水灌新田。\n常勤侣鹤岩崖下，寂静俦猿烟雾边。\n欲访未知何处住，料应霞举已成仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钟子炼丹","author":"朱元璋","text":"翠微高处渺清烟，知子机藏辟谷坚。\n丹鼎铅砂勤火候，溪云岩谷傲松年。\n漂龙掣电深渊底，崖虎生风迥洞边。\n径已苔蒙人未履，昂霄足蹑斗牛天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风","author":"朱元璋","text":"我爱东风从东来，花心与我一般开。\n花成子结应花盛，春满乾坤始凤台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新□水","author":"朱元璋","text":"片云风驾雨飞来，顷刻凭看润九垓。\n槛外近聆新水响，遥穹一碧见天开。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨坠应落花赓徐瑛韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"人道春归实不归，但知结实蕊枝稀。\n昨朝一夜如膏雨，正是花飞子就时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赓吴哲韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"时近清和气愈浓，雨催花实喜晴风。\n篱边点点如钱大，尽是青青间绿红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赓宋璲韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"清和未至尚春风，花幕园林似锦红。\n细雨只教成子速，蕊飞彩蝶最多功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赓曹文寿韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"翩翻飞舞布田垓，似絮还疑玉蕊梅。\n一夜扑窗春蝶戏，好风吹去又推来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赓张翼韵","author":"朱元璋","text":"腊前三白旷无涯，应是天公降六华。\n九曲河深凝底冻，张骞无处再乘槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]